ss_class\":\"Δp 16 for Q3 ≤ 63 m³/h\"}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN100\",\"pressure_loss_class\":\"Δp 40\",\"alternative_pressure_loss_class\":\"Δp 16 for Q3 ≤ 100 m³/h\"}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN125\",\"pressure_loss_class\":\"Δp 16\",\"alternative_pressure_loss_class\":\"N/A\"}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN150\",\"pressure_loss_class\":\"Δp 40\",\"alternative_pressure_loss_class\":\"Δp 16 for Q3 ≤ 250 m³/h\"}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN200\",\"pressure_loss_class\":\"Δp 16\",\"alternative_pressure_loss_class\":\"N/A\"}\n\nSoftware tables:\nBootloader rows:\n{\"software_version\":\"01.00\",\"crc_checksum\":\"63A2EDED\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.01\",\"crc_checksum\":\"67AEA1E4\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.02\",\"crc_checksum\":\"DE7A99AB\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.02\",\"crc_checksum\":\"0CC44DD4\"}\n\nFirmware rows:\n{\"software_version\":\"01.05\",\"crc_checksum\":\"CAA8A4C7\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.15\",\"crc_checksum\":\"6AA50C55\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.16\",\"crc_checksum\":\"E93E3A1E\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.21\",\"crc_checksum\":\"79413617\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.23\",\"crc_checksum\":\"E7DD52E4\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.36\",\"crc_checksum\":\"E1A52981\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.38\",\"crc_checksum\":\"C2641A99\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.42\",\"crc_checksum\":\"2B6CF4C7\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.44\",\"crc_checksum\":\"D867EC79\"}\n{\"software_version\":\"01.47\",\"crc_checksum\":\"7144DCB7\"}\n\nIndicating device full bore:\ncolumns [\"meter_size\",\"indicating_range_minimum_value\",\"verification_scale_interval\"], units [null,\"m³\",\"m³\"]\nrows:\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN32\",\"indicating_range_minimum_value\":99999,\"verification_scale_interval\":0.0001}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN40, DN50\",...:99999, 0.001}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN65, DN80, DN100\",...:999999, 0.001}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN125, DN150\",...:999999, 0.01}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN200, DN250, DN300\",...:9999999, 0.01}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN350, DN400, DN450, DN500, DN600\",...:9999999, 0.1}\n\nReduced:\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN50\",99999,0.0001}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN65\",99999,0.001}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN80, DN100, DN125, DN150\",999999,0.001}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN200\",999999,0.01}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN250, DN300, DN350, DN400\",9999999,0.01}\n{\"meter_size\":\"DN450, DN500, DN600\",9999999,0.1}\n\nDescriptions: add short description strings.\n\nRevision history:\n[\n {\"revision\":\"Initial\",\"date\":\"2019-05-24\",\"changes\":null},\n {\"revision\":\"1\",\"date\":\"2021-02-04\",\"changes\":\"Addition of MUT1000EL and full-bore sizes DN32 and DN40; lowering pressure loss class of MUT2300\"},\n {\"revision\":\"2\",\"date\":\"2022-05-10\",\"changes\":\"Addition of electronic hardware module (Bluetooth&RS485 and/or 4-20mA output); addition of new software\"},\n {\"revision\":\"3\",\"date\":\"2022-07-07\",\"changes\":\"Software update\"},\n {\"revision\":\"4\",\"date\":\"2023-02-14\",\"changes\":\"Software update\"},\n {\"revision\":\"5\",\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"changes\":\"Update of electronic hardware module; software update\"},\n {\"revision\":\"6\",\"date\":\"2026-08-10\",\"changes\":\"Address change, addition of new sizes, increase of Q3 values, addition of new software and minor hardware change\"}\n]\n\nTest reports:\n[\n {\"id\":\"NMi-15200444-01\",\"date\":\"2016-03-31\",\"pages\":39,\"role\":\"type_evaluation_report\"},\n {\"id\":\"NMi-16200309-01\",\"date\":\"2018-03-22\",\"pages\":29,\"role\":\"type_evaluation_report\"},\n {\"id\":\"NMi-1902198-01\",\"date\":\"2018-12-03\",\"pages\":16,\"role\":\"type_evaluation_report\"},\n {\"id\":\"NMi-2186686-01\",\"date\":\"2019-05-24\",\"pages\":43,\"role\":\"type_evaluation_report\"},\n {\"id\":\"NMi-2186686-02\",\"date\":\"2019-05-24\",\"pages\":47,\"role\":\"type_evaluation_report\"},\n {\"id\":\"NMi-2463352-01\",\"date\":\"2021-01-18\",\"pages\":27,\"role\":\"type_evaluation_report\"},\n {\"id\":\"NMi-3369067-01\",\"date\":\"2022-05-10\",\"pages\":13,\"role\":\"type_evaluation_report\"},\n {\"id\":\"NMi-3670720-01\",\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"pages\":12,\"role\":\"type_evaluation_report\"},\n {\"id\":\"NMi-4086814-01\",\"date\":\"2026-08-10\",\"pages\":21,\"role\":\"type_evaluation_report\"},\n {\"id\":\"T10713-10\",\"role\":\"documentation_file\"}\n]\n\nShould I add revision \"1\" to NMi-16200309-01? Extra field, add \"revision\":\"1\". OK.\n\nType-level characteristics — final:\n\n\"measuring_principle\": {\"value\":\"Electromagnetic\",\"unit_symbol\":null,\"unit_id\":null}\n\"environmental_class\": {\"value\":\"M1 / O (installed outdoors)\",\"unit_symbol\":null,\"unit_id\":null}\n\"ambient_temperature_range\": {\"value\":{\"min\":-25,\"max\":55},\"unit_symbol\":\"°C\",\"unit_id\":\"u:degree_Celsius\"}\n\"water_temperature_class\": {\"value\":\"T50\",...}\n\"water_temperature_range\": {\"value\":{\"min\":0.1,\"max\":50},\"unit_symbol\":\"°C\",\"unit_id\":\"u:degree_Celsius\"}\n\"maximum_admissible_pressure\": {\"value\":1.6,\"unit_symbol\":\"MPa\",\"unit_id\":null}\n\"maximum_admissible_pressure_bar\": {\"value\":16,\"unit_symbol\":\"bar\",\"unit_id\":null}\n\"orientation\": {\"value\":\"All positions (horizontal, vertical or diagonal)\",...}\n\"flow_profile_sensitivity_class\": {\"value\":\"U0 and D0 (0 x DN upstream and 0 x DN downstream)\",...}\n\"reverse_flow\": {\"value\":\"designed to measure reverse flow\",...}\n\"ratio_q2_q1\": {\"value\":1.6,...} — with note \"maximum/typical\"? The note says ratio Q2/Q1 = 1.6 for the stated values (min values). Keep as \"ratio_q2_q1\".\n\"ratio_q4_q3\": {\"value\":1.25,...}\n\"minimum_ratio_q3_q1\": {\"value\":40,...}\n\nConfig level:\n\n[\n {\n  \"attribute\":\"electromagnetic_environment\",\n  \"axis\":\"converter type and configuration\",\n  \"values\":[\n    {\"condition\":\"MC406M, remote version\",\"value\":\"E1\"},\n    {\"condition\":\"MC406M, compact version\",\"value\":\"E2\"},\n    {\"condition\":\"MC406AM, compact and remote version\",\"value\":\"E2\"},\n    {\"condition\":\"MC406M or MC406AM, compact and remote version, with Bluetooth&RS485 and/or 4-20mA output\",\"value\":\"E1\"}\n  ]\n },\n {\n  \"attribute\":\"pressure_loss_class\",\n  \"axis\":\"type and meter size\",\n  \"values\":[\n    {\"condition\":\"MUT1000EL/MUT2200EL (full bore), all sizes, per documentation 10713/6-01, 10713/6-02 and 10713/12-01\",\"value\":\"Δp 10\"},\n    {\"condition\":\"MUT2300 (reduced bore), sizes < DN80, per documentation 10713/1-01\",\"value\":\"Δp 25\"},\n    {\"condition\":\"MUT2300 (reduced bore), sizes ≥ DN80, per documentation 10713/1-01\",\"value\":\"Δp 40\"},\n    {\"condition\":\"MUT2300 (reduced bore), sizes < DN250, per documentation 10713/4-03, 10713/12-02 and 10713/12-03\",\"value\":\"see pressure loss class table\"},\n    {\"condition\":\"MUT2300 (reduced bore), sizes ≥ DN250, per documentation 10713/4-03, 10713/12-02 and 10713/12-03\",\"value\":\"Δp 40 (0.040 MPa or 0.40 bar)\"}\n  ]\n },\n {\n  \"attribute\":\"power_supply_voltage\",\n  \"axis\":\"power source\",\n  \"values\":[\n    {\"condition\":\"replaceable battery\",\"value\":{\"min\":2.9,\"max\":3.7},\"unit_symbol\":\"V\"},\n    {\"condition\":\"DC mains (only for MC406AM)\",\"value\":{\"min\":10,\"max\":28},\"unit_symbol\":\"V\"}\n  ]\n }\n]\n\nOK. Now assemble everything. Length is large; write carefully.\n\nAlso decide \"models\" label text: \nFB: \"label\": \"MUT1000EL or MUT2200EL (full bore), DN32\"\nRB: \"label\": \"MUT2300 (reduced bore), DN50\"\n\nTo save space maybe label only for first? No — include for all.\n\nActually, to reduce redundancy: since the model_id already says \"Full bore DN32\", label can be \"MUT1000EL/MUT2200EL DN32\". Keep short.\n\nFinal JSON assembly. Let me write it now, being meticulous.\n\nOne concern: unit_symbol \"m³/h\" — use the superscript ³ character as in source. Yes.\n\nAlso \"°C\" fine.\n\nDouble-check accuracy_class at model level — I'm slightly uneasy about assigning 2 to MUT1000EL (unverified). Alternative: mark model_level accuracy_class values with footnote? No footnotes exist. I'll add a description in the accuracy_class entry? Not allowed by shape (attribute, unit_symbol, values). Hmm. I could put in matrix_tables... The Table 1 statement is clear: MUT2200EL → 2, MUT2300 → 1. Full bore = \"MUT1000EL or MUT2200EL\". The accuracy class 2 applies to the full-bore family via MUT2200EL. I'll assign FB=2. And to be transparent, mention in certified_type.description: \"Accuracy class 2 (MUT2200EL), accuracy class 1 (MUT2300)\". Good.\n\nWrite final answer now. I'll produce compact JSON (indentation minimal but readable-ish). Single object.\n\nLet me count the models entries — 30 with model_id+label. Write them out:\n\nFB: DN32, DN40, DN50, DN65, DN80, DN100, DN125, DN150, DN200, DN250, DN300, DN350, DN400, DN450, DN500, DN600 (16)\nRB: DN50, DN65, DN80, DN100, DN125, DN150, DN200, DN250, DN300, DN350, DN400, DN450, DN500, DN600 (14)\n\nGood. Now write.",
